<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέμω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>herdsman,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες τ᾽ ἄνδρες τε νομῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.65
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύω δ᾽ ἅμ᾽ ἕποντο
			νομῆες,</span> opp. the chief herdsman, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.214
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.246
			</span></i>: generic term including the special <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰπόλος, βουκόλος, ποιμήν, συβώτης,</span> cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				174d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				370d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶν ἀγέλης ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.2.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. προβάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1161a14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dealer out, distributor,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					931d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Min.</u>
				317d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				321b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> pl., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκοίλια</span>
			, <i>ribs</i> of a ship, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.96
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοῖνοι ἀρμένων</span>
			, Id.</div>
